```catala

declaration structure Foo:
  data bla content integer

declaration scope Foo:
  output bla content decimal

scope Foo:
  definition bla equals 0.

declaration scope A:
  foo scope Foo
  internal foo content Foo
  output a content decimal

scope A:
  definition foo equals Foo {--bla: 1}
  definition a equals foo.bla
```

```catala-test-inline
$ catala Interpret -s A
[RESULT] Computation successful! Results:
[RESULT] a = 0.
```
